                                                                               
 Usage: soup [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...                                       
                                                                               
 Fine-tune and post-train LLMs in one command. No SSH, no config hell.         
                                                                               
 GitHub: https://github.com/MakazhanAlpamys/Soup                               
                                                                               
┌─ Options ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ --version                            Show Soup CLI version.                 │
│ --verbose             -V             Show full traceback on errors          │
│ --log-level                   <str>  Logging tier: quiet | normal | verbose │
│                                      | debug                                │
│                                      [default: normal]                      │
│ --no-audit-log                       Disable the local HIPAA/SOC2 audit log │
│                                      for this invocation (also via          │
│                                      SOUP_NO_AUDIT_LOG=1). Default: a       │
│                                      one-line record per command under      │
│                                      ~/.soup/audit.jsonl. v0.71.3.          │
│ --no-telemetry                       Opt-out of anonymous hardware-only     │
│                                      telemetry for this run.                │
│ --install-completion                 Install completion for the current     │
│                                      shell.                                 │
│ --show-completion                    Show completion for the current shell, │
│                                      to copy it or customize the            │
│                                      installation.                          │
│ --help                               Show this message and exit.            │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
┌─ Commands ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ init                        Create a new soup.yaml config interactively or  │
│                             from a template.                                │
│ train                       Start training from a soup.yaml config.         │
│ chat                        Chat with a fine-tuned model in the terminal.   │
│ cost                        Estimate training cost in USD across cloud      │
│                             providers.                                      │
│ push                        Push a trained model to HuggingFace Hub (or     │
│                             alternate hub).                                 │
│ export                      Export a model to GGUF, ONNX, TensorRT-LLM,     │
│                             BitNet, or TorchAO format.                      │
│ merge                       Merge a LoRA adapter with its base model into a │
│                             full model.                                     │
│ card                        Generate a HuggingFace model card from a        │
│                             registry entry.                                 │
│ migrate                     Import a config from LLaMA-Factory, Axolotl, or │
│                             Unsloth notebook.                               │
│ serve                       Start a local inference server with             │
│                             OpenAI-compatible API.                          │
│ sweep                       Run hyperparameter sweep: grid or random search │
│                             over training parameters.                       │
│ diff                        Compare outputs of two models side-by-side on   │
│                             the same prompts.                               │
│ infer                       Run batch inference on a JSONL file of prompts. │
│ profile                     Estimate memory, speed, and GPU requirements    │
│                             BEFORE training.                                │
│ doctor                      Check system dependencies, GPU, and             │
│                             compatibility.                                  │
│ quickstart                  Run a complete demo: create sample data,        │
│                             config, and train.                              │
│ ui                          Launch the Soup Web UI.                         │
│ autopilot                   Autopilot: give model+data+goal, Soup picks     │
│                             optimal hyperparameters.                        │
│ history                     Show the lineage tree for all entries with a    │
│                             given name.                                     │
│ why                         Explain training anomalies for a run in plain   │
│                             English.                                        │
│ rewind                      Name the dataset rows behind a loss spike, from │
│                             the training flight recorder.                   │
│ tui                         Full-screen terminal dashboard: list runs,      │
│                             inspect metrics, tail logs.                     │
│ monitor                     Live GPU monitor: Util / Temp / VRAM / Power    │
│                             per GPU.                                        │
│ fetch                       Fetch a ready-to-edit example config from the   │
│                             bundled catalog.                                │
│ quantize                    Quantize a model - ergonomic alias for `soup    │
│                             export --format <to>`.                          │
│ merge-sharded-fsdp-weights  Consolidate FSDP shard files into a single      │
│                             safetensors file.                               │
│ delinearize-llama4          Delinearize Llama 4 fused expert weights to 3-D │
│                             form.                                           │
│ diagnose                    Post-training report card: forgetting / refusal │
│                             / format / mode_collapse / memorization /       │
│                             contamination (v0.56.0).                        │
│ airgap-bundle               Build a signed tarball with model + datasets +  │
│                             wheels + kernels (v0.60.0).                     │
│ ingest                      Universal trace importer: Langfuse / LangSmith  │
│                             / Helicone / OpenPipe / OTel / OpenAI Stored    │
│                             Completions (v0.63.0).                          │
│ prune-prompt                Detect + strip a shared system-prompt prefix    │
│                             across training data so the FT model            │
│                             internalises it (v0.63.0).                      │
│ ab                          Two-sided mSPRT sequential A/B harness on       │
│                             latency / judge_score / retry_rate: reports     │
│                             whether the treatment is better or worse, valid │
│                             under re-running after every new row (v0.63.0). │
│ drift-alarm                 Rolling-KL drift alarm on output-token          │
│                             distribution with optional Slack/Discord        │
│                             webhook (v0.63.0).                              │
│ tunability                  Probe-train 6-10 small bases on a held-out      │
│                             slice + report Pareto frontier of (eval delta,  │
│                             train cost, license) (v0.64.0).                 │
│ plan                        Render a pre-flight training plan (cost / ETA / │
│                             SHA / VRAM) and write soup.tfstate for `soup    │
│                             apply` to consult (v0.64.0).                    │
│ apply                       Execute the planned training run, refusing on   │
│                             drift between soup.yaml and soup.tfstate        │
│                             (v0.64.0).                                      │
│ completions                 Emit a bash / zsh / fish completion script. Use │
│                             with `eval "$(soup completions bash)"`          │
│                             (v0.64.0).                                      │
│ license-advisor             Recommend a license-clean base for a deploy     │
│                             target (b2c / defense / embedded) + flag        │
│                             downstream risk (v0.64.0).                      │
│ compile                     Compile a DSPy / GEPA prompt program against an │
│                             eval suite (v0.68.0).                           │
│ distill-prompt              Distill prompt-heavy traces into a small FT     │
