│ build                       dbt-for-SFT DAG: validate, plan, and            │
│                             materialise dataset transforms.                 │
│ expect                      Run an expectations suite against a JSONL       │
│                             dataset.                                        │
│ shrink                      Depth-prune a model (drop the least-important   │
│                             contiguous layer block by residual angular      │
│                             distance) + optional distill-heal (v0.71.29).   │
│ version                     Show Soup CLI version.                          │
│ ci                          Fine-tuning CI: init a PR gate workflow.        │
│ data                        Dataset tools: inspect, convert, merge, dedup,  │
│                             validate, stats.                                │
│ deploy                      Deploy models: Ollama integration (deploy,      │
