│ recipes                     Ready-made configs: list, show, use, search     │
│                             recipes for popular models.                     │
│ bench                       Benchmark a model: inference speed (infer, the  │
│                             default) or training (train).                   │
│ registry                    Model Registry: push, list, show, diff, search, │
│                             promote, delete.                                │
│ spectrum                    Spectrum SNR scan for targeted training         │
